  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6006.01 Use of Department Procedures. Unless otherwise provided herein, all hearings conducted by the state fire marshal’s office shall be in accordance with Saf-C 200.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 6000) #13094, eff 8-25-20",
